# Licensing

This repository uses separate licenses for software and research data:

- Source code, scripts, and software configuration are licensed under the MIT
  License. See `LICENSE-CODE`.
- The generated paper catalog, citation-network data, documentation, and other
  original dataset contributions are licensed under the Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0). See `LICENSE-DATA`.

Bibliographic metadata can originate from third-party scholarly indexes and
remains subject to applicable source terms and rights. This repository does not
redistribute article full text.
